  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Rechargeable Power Kit features a compact PCB design with a Type-C charging port, a switch, and two ZH1.5 connectors, along with a charging indicator and protection function. Equipped with a 500RPM N20 motor, compact in size and offering high torque, it is suitable for various small products. Users can easily connect the battery and appliances (such as motors and LEDs) without soldering, making it perfect for creating mini handheld devices like fans and flashlights."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Example of a model using this kit (includes other Maker's Supply parts)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "*Note: This model requires additional Maker's Supply parts for full assembly. Please check the model link for the complete BOM list."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Please ensure that the motherboard battery and output interface are connected correctly according to the markings. Incorrect connections may affect device usage and charging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Please use within the rated power."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h1 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h1>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><br/><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/7be8cf00072247e8a7c91c37339fb237/Rechargeable_Power_Kit-ZC003_model.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> 3D Model </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h3>\n<br/>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">This<strong> Rechargeable Power Kit</strong> features a compact PCB design with a Type-C charging port, a switch, and two ZH1.5 connectors, along with a charging indicator and protection function. Equipped with a 500RPM N20 motor, compact in size and offering high torque, it is suitable for various small products. Users can easily connect the battery and appliances (such as motors and LEDs) without soldering, making it perfect for creating mini handheld devices like fans and flashlights.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pctpct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Example of a model using this kit (includes other Maker's Supply parts)</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/4f95afdb786e4e7ba2de464fb06c9993/226models.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 99.9987%; height: 97.9687px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 58.7812px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; text-align: center; height: 58.7812px;\"><strong>Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; text-align: center; height: 58.7812px;\"><strong>Creators</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; text-align: center; height: 58.7812px;\"><strong>Model Links</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; text-align: center; height: 58.7812px;\"><strong>Need Other Accessories</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 39.1875px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 39.1875px;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Motor Box for Mini Train Dioramas</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; text-align: center; height: 39.1875px;\"><span>@BamBamDesign</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; text-align: center; height: 39.1875px;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1124663-motor-box-for-mini-train-dioramas#profileId-1123818\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Motor Box for Mini Train Dioramas</span></strong></a></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; text-align: center; height: 39.1875px;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/1124663-motor-box-for-mini-train-dioramas#profileId-1123818\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">YES</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;\"><strong>*Note: </strong>This model requires additional Maker's Supply parts for full assembly. Please check the model link for the complete BOM list.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/4504f4244c16435f9648eda464d62302/Compact_Multi-Use_Case_in_two_sizes.jpg\" height=\"1185\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" width=\"2880\"/><br/>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Product Specification</h3>\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\"><b>Packaging Size</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">60x60x30 mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\"><b>Packaging Weight</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">34.3 g</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\"><b>Current</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">1 A</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\"><b>Voltage</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">5 V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\"><b>Charger Board Size</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">25x25.2 mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\"><b>Capacity</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">500 mAh</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\">In the Box</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 285px; width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"background-color: #333333; color: white;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px;\"><strong>Item Number</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px;\"><strong>Item for  Rechargeable Power Kit</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #333333; padding: 10px;\"><strong>Quantity</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">Charger Board</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">2</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">902525 3.7V 500mAh LiPo Battery</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">3</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">N20 Reduction Gear Motor 500rpm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">4</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">M1.6x3 Cross Head Machine Screw</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border: 1px solid #cccccc; padding: 10px;\">5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\"><!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Considerations</h3>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Please ensure that the motherboard battery and output interface are connected correctly according to the markings. Incorrect connections may affect device usage and charging. </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Please use within the rated power.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "This Rechargeable Power Kit features a compact PCB design with a Type-C charging port, a switch, and two ZH1.5 connectors, along with a charging indicator and protection function. Equipped with a 500RPM N20 motor, compact in size and offering high torque, it is suitable for various small products. Users can easily connect the battery and appliances (such as motors and LEDs) without soldering, making it perfect for creating mini handheld devices like fans and flashlights.\n\nExample of a model using this kit (includes other Maker's Supply parts)\n\n*Note: This model requires additional Maker's Supply parts for full assembly. Please check the model link for the complete BOM list.\n\nPlease ensure that the motherboard battery and output interface are connected correctly according to the markings. Incorrect connections may affect device usage and charging.\n\nPlease use within the rated power.",
